    "image": "",
    "date": "2026-05-29T00:00:00.000Z",
    "content": "## Welcome to PulseNet!\n\nThis is your personal game news and dev log site. Here's how to get started:\n\n### Writing Articles\n\nClick the **✦ WRITER** button in the top right and enter your passcode to open the editor.\n\n### Publishing to GitHub Pages\n\n1. Write your articles in the editor\n2. Export the `articles.json` file\n3. Put it in the same folder as `index.html`\n4. Commit and push to your repo\n\n> Your friends will see your articles at your GitHub Pages link automatically.\n\n### Markdown Support\n\nArticles support full Markdown formatting:\n\n- **Bold** and *italic* text\n- Headings with ## and ###\n- Blockquotes\n- Lists\n- `Inline code`\n\n---\n\nHave fun building!"
  }
]
